<title>USA: Colombia's Corfivalle names new president.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Corfivalle names new president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corporacion Financiera del Valle SA said Thursday that Julio Manuel Ayerbe has resigned as president.</p>
<p>The company, Colombia's largest finance corporation, said it has named former Executive Vice President of Investment Banking Luis Carlos Valenzuela as the new president.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
